  "description": "Funeral director Hyeonu is assigned to an unclaimed body that leaves behind only three characters for a name: “Im Se-hyeon.” As he lifts the shroud to send off the deceased on their final journey, just as he has done countless times before, he finds himself breathless at the sight of Se-hyeon’s face, which is bizarrely vibrant and impossibly beautiful.\n\nPerhaps it’s because that brief yet intense first encounter is burned deeply into his mind. Starting that very night, Se-hyun begins to visit Hyeonu’s home ... reaching out with a dangerous and intoxicating touch. *(Source: Lezhin, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/ghost_lover)",
